\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 Sarah vs Eloise \'97 Project Kebab Escalation Arc\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2><$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Core pressure\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The Sarah\'96Eloise conflict grows from three things converging:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hayley uncovers an earlier Shakti research programme involving interacting stasis fields.
\f2\b0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Project Kebab begins reproducing and extending the same class of behaviour.
\f2\b0 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Johnny claims ownership of engineering decisions he plainly did not make.
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Sarah therefore stops asking only whether Project Kebab is dangerous.\
She begins asking:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How much of this has Shakti already understood before?
\f2\b0 \
And then:\

\f1\b What does Eloise know that she has not told me?
\f2\b0 \
The conflict should preserve genuine ambiguity.\
Eloise may have:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 deliberately revived an old research direction;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 recognised similarities only after Kebab began producing comparable results;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 encouraged Shakti Engineering to explore broadly without specifying an end-state;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 relied on institutional knowledge she regarded as ordinary engineering history;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 or consciously allowed the same ethical boundary to be crossed again because she still believes the original research should never have been stopped.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The strongest version does not make Eloise secretly evil.\
It makes her 
\f1\b consistent
\f2\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 Hayley\'92s investigation \'97 the historical spine\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Hayley begins by looking for a hidden weapons project shadowing Project Kebab.\
She searches:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 adjacent projects;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 predecessor projects;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 cancelled programmes;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 migrated budgets;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 dormant research;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 anything that might constitute a second Gyges programme.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 She finds no hidden Project Kebab.\
That matters.\
The investigation does 
\f1\b not
\f2\b0  uncover a covert weapons lab.\
Instead, Hayley finds something more useful: a prior Shakti programme that began with an innocuous safety problem and drifted into deliberately exploiting interacting stasis fields.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 The old Shakti programme\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Its declared purpose was benign:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 reduce interference between stasis units operating in close proximity.
\f2\b0 \
Warehouses.\
Hospitals.\
Transport hubs.\
Anywhere shielding each stasis unit separately was expensive or inconvenient.\
Fridge Force approved limited testing.\
Then stopped it.\
The authorised research had been intended to 
\f1\b suppress interaction
\f2\b0  between neighbouring fields.\
The later research did the opposite.\
The Shakti team deliberately:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 increased coupling between fields;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 changed relative phase;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 increased separation from monitoring targets;\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 explored effects outside the nominal test volume.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 Remote effects appeared.\
Fridge Force suspended the programme.\
There had been no accident.\
That distinction matters.\
The researchers had moved deliberately from:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 How do we stop these fields interacting?
\f2\b0 \
to:\

\f1\b What can we make them do when they interact?
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Fridge Force\'92s concern\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 The Fridge Force review avoided directly accusing Shakti of building a weapon.\
Instead it used terms such as:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 directed field effects
\f2\b0 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 remote material disruption
\f2\b0 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 applications inconsistent with the declared purpose of the research
\f2\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The report included the crucial sentence:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 The demonstrated effects have plausible military application.
\f2\b0 \
This becomes one of the most important historical facts in Sarah\'92s later confrontation with Eloise.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b\fs28 Eloise\'92s previous defence\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f2 Eloise personally fought the suspension.\
Her argument was strong.\
Fridge Force, she argued, had mistaken 
\f1\b investigation of a hazard
\f2\b0  for 
\f1\b intention to exploit a hazard
\f2\b0 .\
Researchers could not learn how to make interacting fields safe without understanding what happened when they interacted badly.\
Stopping the programme because its tests revealed dangerous effects was like banning crash tests because cars got damaged.\
The appeal attacks Fridge Force\'92s:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 competence;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 methodology;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 jurisdiction;\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 technical interpretation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 But Eloise does 
\f1\b not
\f2\b0  dispute:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 The demonstrated effects have plausible military application.
\f2\b0 \
That omission matters.\
The appeal fails.\
The programme closes.\
Hayley finds no evidence that:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 it restarted under another name;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 it moved elsewhere within Shakti;\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 it produced a weapon.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 So Hayley uncovers 
\f1\b less than a conspiracy and more than a coincidence
\f2\b0 .\
Shakti had already travelled once from benign field-interference research into deliberate exploitation of interacting fields.\
And Eloise had already understood what Fridge Force believed those effects could be used for.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 Why Hayley\'92s discovery matters to Sarah\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Without Hayley\'92s investigation, the elliptical-rail apparatus is merely suspiciously sophisticated.\
With it, Sarah has a historical pattern.\
The old programme followed this progression:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 safety problem\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  interaction discovered\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  interaction deliberately strengthened\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  phase manipulated\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  remote effects observed\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  military implications recognised
\f2\b0 \
Project Kebab begins following a disturbingly similar path:\

\f1\b unstable Gyges interaction\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  improved control\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  phase control\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  geometry control\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  deliberate coherence\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  dynamic field interaction\uc0\u8232 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  remote/multi-universal effects
\f2\b0 \
Sarah is therefore not imagining a pattern from nothing.\
She has evidence that 
\f1\b Shakti has crossed this conceptual boundary before
\f2\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f1\b\fs36 Initial state of Project Kebab\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f2 Sarah accepts that Shakti Engineering has been tasked with making Project Kebab safer and more controllable.\
Earlier apparatuses have been unstable.\
The elliptical-rail machine therefore has a reasonable declared purpose:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 better control of two interacting Gyges discs.
\f2\b0 \
